        "subject": "Your YouTube Content is Ready!",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<h1>Your Content is Ready!</h1><p>Hi {{ $json.client_name }},</p><p>Your YouTube content has been processed successfully!</p><p><strong>Included:</strong></p><ul><li>X (Twitter) Posts - 3 posts</li><li>LinkedIn Posts - 2 posts</li><li>Instagram Captions - 2 posts with hashtags</li><li>Content Hooks - AI analysis</li><li>Vizard AI Shorts - Processing</li></ul><p><strong>Source Video:</strong> {{ $json.video_url }}</p><p><a href=\"{{ $json.folder_url }}\" style=\"background:#667eea;color:white;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:5px;display:inline-block;margin:20px 0;\">Access Your Content on Google Drive</a></p><p>Folder: {{ $json.folder_name }}</p><p>Best regards,<br>Content Automation Team</p>",
